00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:05.920
you? Don't you want to work a nine to five job&nbsp;
and I said no I don’t. The hours don't matter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.840
and so I look at the choices we're presented in&nbsp;
terms of how it's possible to live your life and I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:19.440
try to do something different and maybe that's&nbsp;
sort of a bit of a Generation X rebel in me but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:26.640
also something of I just can't do I can't accept a&nbsp;
thing as like this is the only option right? Which&nbsp;&nbsp;

